<title>CROATIA: WEIGHTLIFTING-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>WEIGHTLIFTING-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>RIJEKA, Croatia 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the European</p>
<p>weightlifting championships on Friday:</p>
<p>76 kg</p>
<p>1. Ioto Iotov (Bulgaria) snatch 160.0 kg/clean and jerk 195.0</p>
<p>kg/total lift 355.0 kg</p>
<p> 2. Ingo Steinhofel (Germany)    157.5/192.5/350.0</p>
<p> 3. Rouslan Savcenko (Ukraine)   160.0/190.0/350.0</p>
<p>83 kg</p>
<p> 1. Mark Huster (Germany)	  170.0/207.5/377.5</p>
<p> 2. Dursun Sevinc (Turkey)	 167.5/205.0/372.5</p>
<p> 3. Yuri Miskovec (Russia)	 170.0/200.0/370.0</p>
